{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-masquerade/1487731-st-vault-idea-research","id":1487731,"title":"ST Vault idea research","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","World of Darkness","Vampire: The Masquerade"],"posts":[{"date":"2022-07-24T08:15:37-07:00","id":1487731,"title":"ST Vault idea research","content":"Hi all!<br /> I am considering the idea of creating a supplement for the Storytellers' Vault. <br /> Before starting the hard work, I have decided to do some market research to see if people would be interested in the supplement.<br /> The idea I am working with is a V20 supplement set during the Russian Revolution and Civil War. I would deal with the birth of the Brujah Council, it would show different Anarch societies that would not survive the civil war and the Council repression and, of course, it would explore an area of the WoD that has barely (and badly) been described so far. <br /> I am planning to include different types of campaigns, from the political game in Petrograd in the years previous to the revolution to the anarchy and violence of the civil war, with several in-betweens. <br /> So, what do you guys think about this? Would it sound interesting? Is there anything that you would include, any advice that you would give me? Thank you very much","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/27429-microcuchon","name":"Microcuchon","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2022"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"201"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2022-07-24T11:27:28-07:00","id":1487751,"title":"","content":"The idea seems promising, although I have one important question:<br /> <br /> Are you Russian?","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>#NothingAboutUsWithoutUs<br /> #AutismPride<br /> She/her pronouns","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/5826-monteparnas","name":"monteparnas","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar5826_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"6710"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2022-07-24T14:55:54-07:00","id":1487787,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>monteparnas</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-masquerade/1487731-st-vault-idea-research?p=1487751#post1487751\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">The idea seems promising, although I have one important question:<br /> <br /> Are you Russian?</div> </div> </div> </div>I am not Russian, but I live in Russia, I speak the language and my future wife is Russian. Additionally I have a major in world contemporary history.<br /> Those are some of the reasons why I chose this specific time and place","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":3}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/27429-microcuchon","name":"Microcuchon","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2022"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"201"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2022-07-24T18:13:36-07:00","id":1487820,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Microcuchon</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-masquerade/1487731-st-vault-idea-research?p=1487787#post1487787\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I am not Russian, but I live in Russia, I speak the language and my future wife is Russian. Additionally I have a major in world contemporary history.<br /> Those are some of the reasons why I chose this specific time and place</div> </div> </div> </div>Then by all means, go for it!<br /> <br /> Just keep in mind that this particular time period will touch a lot of sensible buttons for people all around the world.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>#NothingAboutUsWithoutUs<br /> #AutismPride<br /> She/her pronouns","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/5826-monteparnas","name":"monteparnas","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar5826_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"6710"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2022-07-24T18:50:21-07:00","id":1487824,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>monteparnas</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-masquerade/1487731-st-vault-idea-research?p=1487820#post1487820\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Then by all means, go for it!<br /> <br /> Just keep in mind that this particular time period will touch a lot of sensible buttons for people all around the world.</div> </div> </div> </div>I am fully aware. It even touches my sensitive political buttons, as my political ideas would have placed me in the side of those betrayed by the bolsheviks. So I am planning to show the civil war as a struggle between four axis (red Vs white, but also freedom Vs authoritarianism in both sides) and to show how war and violence paves the way for authoritarians to win (an issue that is still relevant nowadays)<br /> And regarding the Russian topic, my idea is to break the unidimensional stereotypes present in the WoD so far (although the small entry in Victorian Age seemed to be going in the right direction). Petrograd, Moscow and many other cities west of the Urals will have a complex representation of most Clans, sects and ideas, at least pre Revolution.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/27429-microcuchon","name":"Microcuchon","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2022"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"201"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2022-07-24T19:13:18-07:00","id":1487826,"title":"","content":"At the risk of bringing up a <i>very</i> ugly topic, remember that this was roughly when the <a href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Black_Hundreds\" target=\"_blank\">Black Hundreds</a> published <a href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/The_Protocols_of_the_Elders_of_Zion\" target=\"_blank\"><i>the</i> most widespread antisemitic propaganda of <i>all time</i></a>.<br /> <br /> I can understand you not wanting to dwell on it, but it's a major part of the time, even if the Gentiles then didn't realize it.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":3201,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3201-father-enoch","user":"Father Enoch","date":". 07-24-2022, 10:40 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":3}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3201-father-enoch","name":"Father Enoch","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3201_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"285"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2022-07-24T19:39:53-07:00","id":1487830,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Father Enoch</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-masquerade/1487731-st-vault-idea-research?p=1487826#post1487826\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">At the risk of bringing up a <i>very</i> ugly topic, remember the <a href=\"https://&amp;quot;&#91;url\" target=\"_blank\">https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Black_Hundreds&amp;quot;]Black</a> Hundreds[/URL], published <a href=\"https://&amp;quot;&#91;url\" target=\"_blank\">https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/The_Protocols_of_the_Elders_of_Zion&amp;quot;]</a><i>the</i> most widespread antisemitic propaganda of <i>all time</i>[/URL]. <br /> <br /> I can understand you not wanting to dwell on it, but it's a major part of the time, even if the Gentiles then didn't realize it.</div> </div> </div> </div>I was aware that &quot;the Protocols&quot; had been published in Russia but I didn't know the name of the organisation, so thanks for the info. Ignoring antisemitism in the setting would be a mistake, in my opinion. And both sides were guilty of it. Trotsky's origins were certainly a decisive factor on him being sidelined in favour of Lenin and Stalin","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/27429-microcuchon","name":"Microcuchon","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2022"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"201"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2022-07-24T20:02:00-07:00","id":1487833,"title":"","content":"The Black Hundreds are the kind of very ugly topic that must be brought up and, curiously, is probably what will be the least controversial in such a book. Not entirely free of it, unfortunately, but still.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>#NothingAboutUsWithoutUs<br /> #AutismPride<br /> She/her pronouns","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/5826-monteparnas","name":"monteparnas","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar5826_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"6710"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2022-07-24T21:09:15-07:00","id":1487840,"title":"","content":"It sounds like an interesting, even a very interesting, subject for a book. Good luck.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1208-grumpy-rpg-reviews","name":"Grumpy RPG Reviews","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1208_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1888"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2022-07-24T21:15:26-07:00","id":1487841,"title":"","content":"Admittedly, all I know about the Black Hundred I've gotten from Wikipedia. But, if the info is right, they were the Proud Boys of Tsarist Russia. <br /> <br /> I'm pretty sure the Proud Boys even use the same colors. And QAnon is definitely the Protocols for the 21st century.<br /> <br /> History may not repeat, but it can still rhyme.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3201-father-enoch","name":"Father Enoch","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3201_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"285"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2022-07-26T02:27:42-07:00","id":1487992,"title":"","content":"It's a tricky one. One of the pitfalls, of course, is the old 'vampires are behind everything' problem of older material. It seems you're aware of that.<br /> <br /> You'd need to strike the right balance of creating a historical backdrop with the appropriate context, and having Cainites respond to that, without also minimising or trivialising the things that actually happened. But a big part of that is tone, so if you can avoid the salacious (looking at you, V5 Camarilla) or the exoticising (and you, WoD: Ethnic Slur), you'll already be ahead of the worst WoD books.<br /> <br /> All of that said, I would definitely buy this book. It sounds really interesting. I'm also generally interested in alternate takes on core rules stuff, too, even if I can't immediately use setting stuff. (I think many of us yearn for V20 stuff with better rules, and historical settings are one of the loopholes for offering a revised core system.)<br /> <br /> One more (potentially) contentious question: does your Russia have the Wan Kuei in it? I can see arguments for and against, but given the diversity of modern and historical Russia, and it's huge size, I could definitely see Wan Kuei in parts of it.<br /> <br /> As V20 hasn't officially delved into the Hungry Dead, that gives you a bit of a clean slate on the matter (though <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/13580-hsienfan\" style=\"background-image:url('https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5//avatar13580_2.jpeg');\" class=\"b-bbcode-user b-bbcode-user--has-avatar js-bbcode-user\" data-userid=\"13580\" data-vbnamecard=\"13580\">Hsienfan</a> has an excellent unofficial update on the subject). Maybe it's just something for an appendix or sidebar, but it could be neat, as I don't think KotE ever really dealt with Russian Hungry Dead in much detail.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Writer, publisher, performer<br /> Mostly he/his, sometimes she/her IRL <a href=\"https://adam-lowe.com\" target=\"_blank\">https://adam-lowe.com</a>","edited":{"userid":5291,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/5291-adambeyoncelowe","user":"adambeyoncelowe","date":". 07-26-2022, 01:23 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/5291-adambeyoncelowe","name":"adambeyoncelowe","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar5291_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Mar 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2802"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2022-07-26T03:42:16-07:00","id":1488000,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Father Enoch</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-masquerade/1487731-st-vault-idea-research?p=1487841#post1487841\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Admittedly, all I know about the Black Hundred I've gotten from Wikipedia. But, if the info is right, they were the Proud Boys of Tsarist Russia. <br /> <br /> I'm pretty sure the Proud Boys even use the same colors. And QAnon is definitely the Protocols for the 21st century.<br /> <br /> History may not repeat, but it can still rhyme.</div> </div> </div> </div>How very funny. I would relate Qanon instead to Operation Trust.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/27252-hades","name":"Hades","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2021"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"110"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2022-07-26T07:58:33-07:00","id":1488030,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>adambeyoncelowe</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-masquerade/1487731-st-vault-idea-research?p=1487992#post1487992\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">The big pitfall, of course, is the old 'vampires are behind everything' problem of older material.</div> </div> </div> </div>That would be a problem, but I do think that this one has a bigger pitfall to it. But Microcuchon is already aware of that.<br /> <br /> Otherwise, agree.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>#NothingAboutUsWithoutUs<br /> #AutismPride<br /> She/her pronouns","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/5826-monteparnas","name":"monteparnas","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar5826_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"6710"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2022-07-26T10:06:38-07:00","id":1488043,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Hades</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-masquerade/1487731-st-vault-idea-research?p=1488000#post1488000\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">How very funny. I would relate Qanon instead to Operation Trust.</div> </div> </div> </div>Nope, the parallels are definitely between QAnon and the Protocols.<br /> <br /> The Protocols claimed political reformers and critics of a controversial monarch were part of a worldwide conspiracy.<br /> <br /> QAnon claimed opponents and critics of a controversial president were part of a worldwide conspiracy.<br /> <br /> Also, both QAnon and the Protocols have a large overlap in the US.<br /> <br /> <a href=\"https://morningconsult.com/2021/06/28/qanon-antisemitism-right-wing-authoritarianism-polling/\" target=\"_blank\">https://morningconsult.com/2021/06/2...anism-polling/</a>","signature":"","edited":{"userid":3201,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3201-father-enoch","user":"Father Enoch","date":". 07-26-2022, 01:12 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3201-father-enoch","name":"Father Enoch","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3201_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"285"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2022-07-26T10:23:21-07:00","id":1488046,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>monteparnas</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-masquerade/1487731-st-vault-idea-research?p=1488030#post1488030\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">That would be a problem, but I do think that this one has a bigger pitfall to it. But Microcuchon is already aware of that.<br /> <br /> Otherwise, agree.</div> </div> </div> </div>True. The word 'big' is the wrong one there ('one of' would be more accurate).","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Writer, publisher, performer<br /> Mostly he/his, sometimes she/her IRL <a href=\"https://adam-lowe.com\" target=\"_blank\">https://adam-lowe.com</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/5291-adambeyoncelowe","name":"adambeyoncelowe","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar5291_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Mar 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2802"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2022-07-26T17:43:49-07:00","id":1488117,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Father Enoch</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-masquerade/1487731-st-vault-idea-research?p=1488043#post1488043\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> Nope, the parallels are definitely between QAnon and the Protocols.<br /> <br /> The Protocols claimed political reformers and critics of a controversial monarch were part of a worldwide conspiracy.<br /> <br /> QAnon claimed opponents and critics of a controversial president were part of a worldwide conspiracy.<br /> <br /> Also, both QAnon and the Protocols have a large overlap in the US.<br /> <br /> <a href=\"https://&amp;quot;https://morningconsult.com/2021/06/28/qanon-antisemitism-right-wing-authoritarianism-polling/&amp;quot;\" target=\"_blank\">https://morningconsult.com/2021/06/2...anism-polling/</a></div> </div> </div> </div>Yes, and both Operation Trust and Qanon were both controlled opposition psyops.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/27252-hades","name":"Hades","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2021"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"110"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2022-07-26T19:18:40-07:00","id":1488125,"title":"","content":"Regarding the Hungry Dead, I haven't decided anything yet. The Far Eastern theater was basically irrelevant and I can't really image any serious vampire involvement. Maybe some Japanese soldiers killed an Autarkis in Vladivostok, but who cares. <br /> The revolution will be a pure Cainite affair in that sense, because the focus is not the Human Revolution, which was a massive one, but how a relatively low amount of vampires used this revolution as a cover to implement their own revolt against the Elders and to explain how the Soviet Union ended up ruled by a Brujah Council that mirrored their authoritarian mortal counterpart","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":3}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/27429-microcuchon","name":"Microcuchon","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2022"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"201"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2022-07-26T22:57:20-07:00","id":1488132,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Microcuchon</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-masquerade/1487731-st-vault-idea-research?p=1488125#post1488125\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Regarding the Hungry Dead, I haven't decided anything yet. The Far Eastern theater was basically irrelevant and I can't really image any serious vampire involvement. Maybe some Japanese soldiers killed an Autarkis in Vladivostok, but who cares. <br /> The revolution will be a pure Cainite affair in that sense, because the focus is not the Human Revolution, which was a massive one, but how a relatively low amount of vampires used this revolution as a cover to implement their own revolt against the Elders and to explain how the Soviet Union ended up ruled by a Brujah Council that mirrored their authoritarian mortal counterpart</div> </div> </div> </div>Good answer. I was more thinking there would be enigmatic hints to these strange vampires lurking in the eastern parts of Russia, rather than that they would be a major part. But this is also fine.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Writer, publisher, performer<br /> Mostly he/his, sometimes she/her IRL <a href=\"https://adam-lowe.com\" target=\"_blank\">https://adam-lowe.com</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/5291-adambeyoncelowe","name":"adambeyoncelowe","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar5291_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Mar 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2802"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2022-07-26T23:44:50-07:00","id":1488133,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>adambeyoncelowe</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-masquerade/1487731-st-vault-idea-research?p=1488132#post1488132\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> Good answer. I was more thinking there would be enigmatic hints to these strange vampires lurking in the eastern parts of Russia, rather than that they would be a major part. But this is also fine.</div> </div> </div> </div>Could you please send me the information about them that you have mentioned? The sidebar idea is quite good","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/27429-microcuchon","name":"Microcuchon","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2022"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"201"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2022-07-27T05:43:17-07:00","id":1488159,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Microcuchon</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-masquerade/1487731-st-vault-idea-research?p=1488133#post1488133\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> Could you please send me the information about them that you have mentioned? The sidebar idea is quite good</div> </div> </div> </div>This thread is where <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/13580-hsienfan\" style=\"background-image:url('https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5//avatar13580_2.jpeg');\" class=\"b-bbcode-user b-bbcode-user--has-avatar js-bbcode-user\" data-userid=\"13580\" data-vbnamecard=\"13580\">Hsienfan</a> is developing a rebooted KotE: <a href=\"https://forum.rpg.net/index.php?threads/kindred-of-the-east-the-relentless-age-live-drafting-a-final-reboot.893999/\" target=\"_blank\">https://forum.rpg.net/index.php?thre...reboot.893999/</a><br /> <br /> Hsienfan also has a book called Analects of the Damned on DTRPG.<br /> <br /> Mongol Wan Kuei are briefly touched upon in Wind from the East. There would be some Central Asian, North Asian/Siberian and East Asian (e.g., around the Japanese islands, where some of the land is Russian) places where you might expect the Wan Kuei to have a minor presence as a result of the Mongol invasion. There would also be some Wan Kuei due to the contact between and proximity of Siberia, China, and the Himalayan region.<br /> <br /> There's some very basic info on Buddhism in Russia that might inform the context: <a href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Buddhism_in_Russia\" target=\"_blank\">https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Buddhism_in_Russia</a><br /> <br /> From there: &quot;By 1887, there were 29 publishing houses and numerous datsans. In 1917 these ethnic regions had among them approximately 20,000 Buddhists and 175 temples.&quot; <br /> <br /> The Buddhist datsans were all closed by Stalin by 1917, which is key for your timeline. By the 1930s, many Buddhists were exiled or worse (but not completely, as Buddhism had a revival in later decades). <br /> <br /> There were also attempts to Westernise the mainly Tibetan Buddhism of Siberia, which would create tensions locally, and might spill over into myths about Buddhist 'demons' among the Kindred. <br /> <br /> That would probably mean the Wan Kuei might be in hiding or in retreat, even if they were a minority before. But that context also creates space for strange myths and legends to emerge from the shadows.<br /> <br /> I'm thinking of the wrathful deities, who might be defending local Buddhist and non-Christian populations from the predations of Kindred (they look like this: <a href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Wrathful_deities\" target=\"_blank\">https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Wrathful_deities</a>). That could be the Wan Kuei trying to strike back and survive. I can see online that a version of the rakshasa (luocha) existed in Siberian Buddhist mythology, which could be Ravnos or illusion-spinning/shapeshifting Wan Kuei.<br /> <br /> There would be a population of dispossed and oppressed people (mainly the indigenous peoples of Buryatia, nearby Tuva, and Kalmykia) among whom the Wan Kuei might hide and prey, in order to protect their own interests, such as dragon's nest, ancestor worship that feeds them and their spirit allies, and so on. There might even be some cool forbidden Buddhist items lost to the expulsions which could form cool story hooks. See info on Buddhist relics here: <a href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Relics_associated_with_Buddha\" target=\"_blank\">https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Relics...ed_with_Buddha</a><br /> <br /> ETA1: This link also looks useful (behind a paywall but you get a number of articles for free, I think?): <a href=\"https://tricycle.org/magazine/buddhism-russia/\" target=\"_blank\">https://tricycle.org/magazine/buddhism-russia/</a><br /> <br /> ETA2: Key Buddhist sites: <a href=\"https://www.rbth.com/travel/330675-buddhist-sites-russia\" target=\"_blank\">https://www.rbth.com/travel/330675-b...t-sites-russia</a>","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Writer, publisher, performer<br /> Mostly he/his, sometimes she/her IRL <a href=\"https://adam-lowe.com\" target=\"_blank\">https://adam-lowe.com</a>","edited":{"userid":5291,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/5291-adambeyoncelowe","user":"adambeyoncelowe","date":". 07-27-2022, 09:25 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/5291-adambeyoncelowe","name":"adambeyoncelowe","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar5291_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Mar 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2802"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2022-07-27T09:40:33-07:00","id":1488178,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>adambeyoncelowe</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-masquerade/1487731-st-vault-idea-research?p=1488159#post1488159\"